{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/waikikibeachservices/items/68066/", "pk": 68066, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/waikikibeachservices/", "pk": 20180, "shortname": "waikikibeachservices", "name": "Waikiki Beach Services", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Beachboy Valet", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 6, "unicode": "Beachboy Valet", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-midnight", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 48.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": false, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 48.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": false, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 1452, "description": "#THE BEACHBOY VALET is the most unique way to experience water activities in Waikīkī. Hire your own personal Waikīkī Beachboy and experience some of the best activities in Waikīkī the way only a genuine Beachboy can! \n\n## Duration \n\n3.5 Hours \n\n##About\nYour personal Beachboy Valet will be there to help you create a morning full of fun and surf--choose your activity and we will handle the rest. Can't decide? Spend some time surf some waves, then take a moment to paddle across the reef on a stand up paddle board, then end your morning with a ride on the outrigger canoe. This is a great activity for beginner surfers and intermediate surfers looking for a challenge.\n\n##Additional Information\n\n - All charges are per person.\n - All of the equipment is provided, including use of a rashguard.\n - Guests can choose to participate in any one of the activities Waikīkī Beach Services offers.\n - A Waikīkī Beachboy’s special training gives him vast knowledge of wind and sea conditions, the reefs and surf breaks, and of the history of Waikīkī and Hawaiʻi.\n - Pregnant women or guests with prior neck or back injuries should not take SURF / SUP lessons.", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "2259 Kalākaua Ave Honolulu, HI 96815", "booking_notes": "![Description of image](https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/dhCpAToQiWvh8xTcxULr)\n#ALOHA,\n\nMahalo for booking with **Waikīkī Beachboys at the Royal Hawaiian**. Please contact us if you have any questions or special requests.\nMahalo,\n\n**The Waikīkī Beach Services Team**\n2255 Kalākaua Ave., Honolulu, HI. 96815\nhttp://www.waikikibeachservices.com \ninfo@waikikibeachservices.com \n(808) 388-1510\n\n#Check In\n\nPlease check in at least 10 minutes prior to your reservation time at our service desk located on the pool deck of The Royal Hawaiian Hotel at 2255 Kalākaua Ave., Honolulu, HI. 96815. Should you get lost or need assistance, please call our desk at (808) 388-1510.\n\n#Things to Remember\n\nPlease bring your own towel. We do not provide towels unless you are a registered guest of The Royal Hawaiian Hotel. Leave valuables at home—there is limited storage available behind our desk. More information can be found in our [FAQs](http://www.waikikibeachservices.com/faqs/) section of our website.", "cancellation_notes": "If you wish to change or cancel your booking, please submit your request via e-mail to info@waikikibeachservices.com at least 48 hours before an activity/rental. No-shows or cancellation requests received within 48 hours will not be eligible for refund.\n\nPlease allow up to 10 business days for refunds to process between banking institutions.", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_trans